description	"Sith Marauder

2-life Saber Focused Warrior Sith with customizable Force Powers and Lightsaber attributes.

^2Weaponry: 
- Melee
- Short Light Saber
-- Saber With Shoto (Duals/Cyan/Purple)
-- Single Saber (Red/Yellow/Blue)
-- Saber Throw ^3[CS1]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Force Focus (2)
- Assemble (1)
- Sith Conditioning (Environmential Protection 1)
- Held By Hatred (Blast Armor)
- Dark Resilience (Healing 1)
- 5% Less Knockback Taken"